  H_weak: 15 distinct values
  H_strict range: [0, 5]
  H_weak range: [1, 24]

  H_strict = 0 count: 359 (49.2%)
  REDEI ANALOG: H_strict >= 1 always? False
  (In binary, Redei guarantees H >= 1. In ternary, ties can block all paths.)

